%% Store listing assets — full flow
%% Pure Mermaid. No Markdown fence around this file.

flowchart TD
    trigger([Redevelop, finalize, Play submission,<br/>or a direct ask for store assets]) --> context[Read tokens, fonts, mark, art,<br/>STORE-LISTING.md and the story surface]

    context --> words{Approved store.graphic.line<br/>and store.shot.* exist?}
    words -->|no| story[Run the story workflow first<br/>aoneahsan-cccs-story-craft]
    story --> words
    words -->|yes| system[Decide the visual system:<br/>brand band, glow, lockup, frame]

    system --> capture[Capture real screens with the<br/>automation browser, non-admin]
    capture --> fresh{Each capture matches the<br/>current app and the listing?}
    fresh -->|no| capture
    fresh -->|yes| build[Build SVG masters:<br/>icon, feature graphic, brand shot, 7 framed shots]

    build --> export[Inline captures, export PNGs<br/>with the documented command]
    export --> look{Contact sheet and full size:<br/>balanced, in margins, no overlap?}
    look -->|no| build
    look -->|yes| repro{Documented export reproduces<br/>every PNG pixel-identical?}
    repro -->|no| export
    repro -->|yes| records[Update STORE-LISTING.md<br/>and the pack README]
    records --> done([Committed with the project])

    system -.read, never copy.-> policy[(~/.claude/policy/<br/>play-console-rejection-rules.json)]
